Shared Python packages for the planning recipe go here.

There are currently none: everything the learner's notebooks and the
duckiematrix agent import lives in the exercise ("meat") repo, because the
live code editor mounts the meat over `packages/` and shadows this directory
(only the deployed image merges recipe + meat). This placeholder keeps
`packages/` present so the Dockerfiles' `COPY --from=recipe ./packages` step
succeeds even when the recipe ships no Python code.
